    <p><br></p>
    <h4 id=3D"DataAnalysis:R2PMSubadvisor-2.InactivePMsub-advisorRRcodes"><=
span style=3D"letter-spacing: -0.003em;">2. Inactive PM sub-advisor RR code=
s</span><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">&nbsp;</span></h4>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"1639cb30-fdb6-46ec-a044-7270adbfeb6b">
      <p>Definition: An RR code is&nbsp;inactive if&nbsp;</p>
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"441a14aa-84dd-490d-949a-6162fe16bd3b">
        <p><code>RRM_RR_STATUS =3D 'I'</code> OR</p></li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"9bccea66-2115-48dc-b5bc-d0026b4ba18d">
        <p><code>RRM_END_DATE</code> =E2=89=A0 <code>0</code> and not blank=
</p></li>
      </ul></li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"94842d95-fdf9-4263-8441-e7354df21eac">
      <p>Why are inactive RR codes found in active users' PM sub-advisor RR=
 codes?</p>
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"2ae8d211-8193-4e81-9ddc-63c314ebea7e">
        <p>Are there loopholes in the user maintenance / RR code offboardin=
g procedure?</p></li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"1a5fde7d-6913-43f9-991e-b682b49cbaac">
        <p>Are there any financial or operation issue?&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li>
      </ul></li>
     <li>
      <p>Why are 5 PM sub-advisors assigned to inactive PM sub-advisor RR c=
odes ONLY?</p>
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"9ec853b6-54ea-43af-bd6d-8698802d44d6">
        <p>Are they not supposed to sub-advise anymore?</p></li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"45476bd4-ff9f-4169-a0d6-15f41c853499">
        <p>Why aren't their PM sub-advisor RR codes cleaned up?</p></li>
      </ul></li>
     <li>
      <p><u><strong>Scope impacts:&nbsp;</strong></u></p>
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"0826ec3a-db83-477a-98a3-fcdaef0949c4">
        <p>Is there a valid process to trigger user profile cleanup in both=
 repcodes field and PM sub-advisor RR code field when RR code deactivation =
from source (CATRRM or Firm360) happens?</p></li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"21bec945-4d0a-4e30-a444-73aac0272963">
        <p>Is there a valid process to de-register a PM sub-advisor user wh=
en they do not have any valid PM sub-advisor RR codes?</p></li>
      </ul></li>
    </ul>
    <p><br></p>
    <p><strong>In a glance</strong></p>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width=
: 78.6273%;">
      <colgroup>
       <col style=3D"width: 63.7982%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 36.166%;">
      </colgroup>
      <tbody>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh"><br></th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Row Count</th>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Number of inactive PM sub-advisor RR cod=
es (no repetition)</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">25</td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Number of users with inactive PM sub-adv=
isor RR codes ONLY</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">5</td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Number of users with one or more inactiv=
e PM sub-advisor RR codes</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">28</td>
       </tr>
      </tbody>
     </table>
    </div>
    <p style=3D"margin-left: 40.0px;"><br>
      &nbsp;</p>
