    <h1 id=3D"DataAnalysis:R2PMSubadvisor-FromNov/2/2026analysisbyProductAc=
tivations">From Nov/2/2026 analysis by Product Activations</h1>
    <p>A <strong>Person</strong> is identified by an exact first + last nam=
e match, which risks merging records of distinct people at different firms.=
 Analysis will be further refined for precision during clean-up and launch =
activities.</p>
    <h2 id=3D"DataAnalysis:R2PMSubadvisor-NetRep">NetRep</h2>
    <h3 id=3D"DataAnalysis:R2PMSubadvisor-Sub-advisor">Sub-advisor</h3>
    <p><strong>Conditions &amp; Considerations</strong></p>
    <p>-No sub-advisor identifier available, assumption is anyone outside p=
arent &amp; child is a sub-advisor</p>
    <p>-Person=E2=80=99s primary firm cannot be identified, and is likely o=
ne of the accesses counted</p>
    <p>-Active Firms</p>
    <p>-External users only</p>
    <p>-ID Status is unavailable</p>
    <p>-Last logged in on or after Jan 1, 2025</p>
    <p>-Persons have multi-parent + multi-firm access</p>
